/**
 * THE BUNDLED DEMO DATASET
 *
 * Law 9 — degrade, never fail. With the API unreachable the store hydrates
 * from here and every screen still renders: the calendar populates, the
 * pipeline animates, drafts exist, analytics charts draw, and Ethara answers
 * on the in-bundle deterministic parser.
 *
 * The shape is `StatePayload` — byte-for-byte what `/api/state` returns — so
 * nothing downstream knows or cares which source it came from.
 *
 * Everything is generated by a seeded PRNG (mulberry32): same seed, same
 * numbers, every reload.
 */

